WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,530
Brother Pegasus

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,380
You and I have not been in conflict with each other for many years

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,180
Why did you suddenly attack me?

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:09,900
Your Pegasus brother asked me to come over and say hello. Don’t run away.

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,180
Let's have a good chat

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,100
Talk about your uncle

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,860
If you dare, come here during the day, Brother Rabbit

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,060
are you blind

9
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,980
The front is the core area

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,580
The core is only better

11
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,780
Just come here if you dare

12
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:26,750
The two of us will die together

13
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,430
Just over a hundred points away from upgrading.

14
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:35,740
This blind rabbit can't be bold

15
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,620
Dare to break into the core area

16
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,650
Don’t you want to live?

17
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:46,620
Discovered by Phoenix

18
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:47,860
Missing you is a crime

19
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,660
Run away quickly

20
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,620
If not

21
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:53,380
He will definitely be turned into a pulp by the Lord of the Peach Forest

22
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,900
The Lord of Peach Grove really discovered me

23
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,140
Already started

24
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:58,060
The more fierce you scream, the more guilty you feel

25
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,500
Let's go, let's go

26
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,580
Going left

27
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:04,060
Will disturb the Lord of Peach Grove

28
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,100
do you want to die

29
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,580
A mere ninth-grade Tang wolf

30
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:07,620
The Lord of the Peach Grove will crush you to death

31
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,660
As easy as squeezing a peach bug to death

32
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:10,940
Dare to take another step forward

33
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:12,460
This is your burial place

34
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:13,700
There must be him working hard ahead

35
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,060
Good things to hide
